      "claim": "Replacement of a theory occurs only when it is shown to be fundamentally untenable and a superior alternative exists.",
      "evidence": "Major paradigm shifts (e.g., geocentric → heliocentric) required overwhelming contradictory evidence, not just a single challenging finding.",
